4. CountryService

Purpose

Acts as the business layer.
Receives requests from the Controller.
Retrieves country data from CountryList.
@Service
public class CountryService {

    @Autowired
    private CountryList countryList;

    public Country getCountry(String code) throws CountryNotFoundException {

        List<Country> countries = countryList.getCountries();

        for (Country country : countries) {
            if(country.getCode().equalsIgnoreCase(code))
                return country;
        }

        throw new CountryNotFoundException();
    }

    public List<Country> getAllCountries() {
        return countryList.getCountries();
    }
}

Explanation

@Service → Marks the class as a Service component.
@Autowired → Injects the CountryList bean.
getCountry() → Searches a country by code.
getAllCountries() → Returns all countries.
